            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "The exception is not thrown, but transaction still doesn't work. Checked out in transaction nodes remain checked out even so there is checkin() method called. So the repository is left in inconsistent state.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mcavity",
            "name": "mcavity",
            "key": "mcavity",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Marcin Cenkier",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2005-10-03T23:53:42.000+0000",
          "updated": "2005-10-03T23:53:42.000+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12317243/comment/12331176",
          "id": "12331176",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=tripod",
            "name": "tripod",
            "key": "tripod",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=tripod&avatarId=17636",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=tripod&avatarId=17636",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=tripod&avatarId=17636",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=tripod&avatarId=17636"
            },
            "displayName": "Tobias Bocanegra",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Tokyo"
          },
          "body": "yes, but this is another bug. see  JCR-141.\n\nthe following test works for me:\n\n    public void testCheckin() throws Exception {\n        // get user transaction object\n        UserTransaction utx = new UserTransactionImpl(superuser);\n\n        // start transaction\n        utx.begin();\n\n        // add node and save\n        Node n = testRootNode.addNode(nodeName1, testNodeType);\n        n.addMixin(mixVersionable);\n        testRootNode.save();\n\n        n.checkin();\n\n        // commit\n        utx.commit();\n\n        assertFalse(\"Node must be checked-in\", n.isCheckedOut());\n    }",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=tripod",
            "name": "tripod",
